ry me-2\"></i>My Medicine History</h3>\n31:             <p class=\"text-muted small mb-0\">Record of verified medicines and pharmacy purchases linked to your account.</p>\n32:           </div>\n33:           <div class=\"d-flex gap-2\">\n34:             <select id=\"historyFilter\" class=\"form-select form-select-sm\" onchange=\"loadCustomerHistory()\">\n35:               <option value=\"ALL\">All Records</option>\n36:               <option value=\"VERIFICATION\">Verifications Only</option>\n37:               <option value=\"PURCHASE\">Purchases Only</option>\n38:             </select>\n39:             <button class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm\" onclick=\"clearAllHistory()\">\n40:               <i class=\"fas fa-trash me-1\"></i> Clear History\n41:             </button>\n42:           </div>\n43:         </div>\n44: \n45:         <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n46:           <table class=\"table table-custom align-middle mb-0\">\n47:             <thead>\n48:               <tr>\n49:                 <th>Medicine</th>\n50:                 <th>Manufacturer</th>\n51:                 <th>Batch Number</th>\n52:                 <th>Activity Type</th>\n53:                 <th>Verification Status</th>\n54:                 <th>Pharmacy / Source</th>\n55:                 <th>Date</th>\n56:                 <th class=\"text-end\">Actions</th>\n57:               </tr>\n58:             </thead>\n59:             <tbody id=\"historyTableBody\">\n60:               <tr><td colspan=\"8\" class=\"text-center py-4 text-muted\">Loading your history records...</td></tr>\n61:             </tbody>\n62:           </table>\n63:         </div>\n64:       </div>\n65:     </div>\n66:   </main>\n67: \n68:   <!-- Dynamic Footer -->\n69:   <div id=\"mainFooter\"></div>\n70: \n71:   <!-- Scripts -->\n72:   <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n73:   <script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n74:   <script src=\"js/auth.js\"></script>\n75:   <script>\n76:     document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n77:       if (!enforceRoleGuard(['customer', 'admin'])) return;\n78:       loadCustomerHistory();\n79:     });\n80: \n81:     async function loadCustomerHistory() {\n82:       const type = document.getElementById('historyFilter').value;\n83:       const tableBody = document.getElementById('historyTableBody');\n84: \n85:       try {\n86:         const res = await fetch(`/api/history?type=${type}`, { headers: getAuthHeaders() });\n87:         const data = await res.json();\n88: \n89:         if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message);\n90: \n91:         const items = data.data || [];\n92:         if (items.length === 0) {\n93:           tableBody.innerHTML = `\n94:             <tr>\n95:               <td colspan=\"8\" class=\"text-center py-5 text-muted\">\n96:                 <i class=\"fas fa-history fa-2x mb-2 d-block opacity-50\"></i>\n97:                 No history entries found. Search and verify medicines to log items here.\n98:               </td>\n99:             </tr>\n100:           `;\n101:           return;\n102:         }\n103: \n104:         tableBody.innerHTML = items.map(item => `\n105:           <tr>\n106:             <td>\n107:               <strong class=\"text-navy\">${item.medicineName}</strong>\n108:               <div class=\"small text-muted\">${item.genericName || ''}</div>\n109:             </td>\n110:             <td>${item.manufacturer || 'N/A'}</td>\n111:             <td class=\"font-monospace small\">${item.batchNumber || 'N/A'}</td>\n112:             <td>\n113:               <span class=\"badge ${item.type === 'PURCHASE' ? 'bg-success' : 'bg-primary'}\">${item.type}</span>\n114:             </td>\n115:             <td>\n116:               <span class=\"status-pill match\">${item.verificationStatus}</span>\n117:             </td>\n118:             <td>${item.pharmacyName || '<span class=\"text-muted small\">MedCheck BD Search</span>'}</td>\n119:             <td class=\"small text-muted\">${formatDate(item.checkedAt)}</td>\n120:             <td class=\"text-end\">\n121:               ${item.medicineId ? `\n122:                 <a href=\"medicine-details.html?id=${item.medicineId._id || item.medicineId}\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm py-0 px-2 me-1\">\n123:                   View\n124:                 </a>\n125:               ` : ''}\n126:               <button class=\"btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm py-0 px-2\" onclick=\"deleteHistoryItem('${item._id}')\">\n127:                 <i class=\"fas fa-trash-alt\"></i>\n128:               </button>\n129:             </td>\n130:           </tr>\n131:         `).join('');\n132:       } catch (err) {\n133:         showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n134:       }\n135:     }\n136: \n137:     async function deleteHistoryItem(id) {\n138:       try {\n139:         const res = await fetch(`/api/history/${id}`, {\n140:           method: 'DELETE',\n141:           headers: getAuthHeaders(),\n142:         });\n143:         const data = await res.json();\n144:         if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message);\n145: \n146:         showToast('Record deleted from history', 'info');\n147:         loadCustomerHistory();\n148:       } catch (err) {\n149:         showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n150:       }\n151:     }\n152: \n153:     async function clearAllHistory() {\n154:       if (!confirm('Are you sure you want to clear your entire medicine history?')) return;\n155: \n156:       try {\n157:         const res = await fetch('/api/history', {\n158:           method: 'DELETE',\n159:           headers: getAuthHeaders(),\n160:         });\n161:         const data = await res.json();\n162:         if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data.message);\n163: \n164:         showToast('History cleared successfully', 'info');\n165:         loadCustomerHistory();\n166:       } catch (err) {\n167:         showToast(err.message, 'danger');\n168:       }\n169:     }\n170:   </script>\n171: </body>\n172: </html>\n173: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
